WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.050
Hi there! I'm Lucy.

00:03.050 --> 00:08.860
We're on the 100 Years Quest, traveling
the continent of Guiltina in the North.

00:08.860 --> 00:13.720
I think I'll look back on what's
happened on the quest so far.

00:13.720 --> 00:15.070
Let's see...

00:15.070 --> 00:20.750
First off, we headed to the oldest
Wizard Guild in the world, Magia Dragon,

00:20.750 --> 00:23.040
to take on the 100 Years Quest.

00:23.040 --> 00:24.490
That's Magia Dragon.

00:24.490 --> 00:25.630
We're here.

00:25.630 --> 00:28.150
Look! There is a dragon!

00:28.150 --> 00:29.910
It's a statue.

00:29.910 --> 00:33.100
So... is there still anyone in this guild?

00:33.100 --> 00:36.150
If there weren't, there wouldn't be a job.

00:37.560 --> 00:42.520
And it was a dragon who welcomed us there.

00:46.470 --> 00:51.070
I welcome thee, 99th hero!

00:55.880 --> 01:03.790
I am the father of all Wizard Guilds and
the first master of Magia Dragon, Elefseria.

01:03.790 --> 01:08.260
Are you certain you're prepared
to take on this quest?

01:09.720 --> 01:12.990
That's why we came here.

01:12.990 --> 01:18.600
And that's how we took on the toughest quest,
which no one has completed in 100 years:

01:18.600 --> 01:20.520
the 100 Years Quest.

01:20.770 --> 01:23.980
Very well. The quest is quite simple.

01:23.980 --> 01:27.470
There are five "Dragon Gods" on Guiltina.

01:27.470 --> 01:28.980
You must seal them away.

01:28.980 --> 01:31.120
Guiltina's Five Dragon Gods?

01:31.120 --> 01:32.610
Five dragons?

01:33.690 --> 01:36.950
Dragon hunt? Now I'm all fired up!

03:08.080 --> 03:12.920
Going Off Topic: Lucy's diary

03:12.920 --> 03:15.380
Oh, there it is!

03:15.720 --> 03:20.800
We first headed to the city of Ermina,
which had ties to the Water Dragon God.

03:16.670 --> 03:18.560
The city of Ermina!

03:21.300 --> 03:23.000
Let's find a place to stay first.

03:23.000 --> 03:24.710
We've gotta find food first!

03:24.710 --> 03:27.270
Let's look for fish! Fish!

03:28.240 --> 03:31.230
More travelers, it seems.

03:31.660 --> 03:36.610
Those are wizards from the southern
continent, honored Water God, Suijin-sama.

03:40.030 --> 03:41.660
What on earth are you?!

03:42.100 --> 03:46.830
The fifth generation of Dragon Slayers,
who gained powers by devouring dragons.

03:47.190 --> 03:49.420
We're the Dragon Eaters!

03:49.420 --> 03:51.250
While we looked for the Water Dragon God,

03:51.250 --> 03:54.920
these mysterious guys named Diabolos,
who were trying to eat dragons,

03:54.920 --> 03:56.360
attacked us out of nowhere.

03:57.380 --> 03:59.090
What is it this time?!

04:03.010 --> 04:07.940
You who seek the blood of dragons,
leave this place at once.

04:08.270 --> 04:11.330
No need. There's nothing I cannot cut.

04:13.230 --> 04:14.790
Is that you, Skullion?!

04:14.790 --> 04:15.990
Stay out of this!

04:15.990 --> 04:18.780
Just wait until you taste my wrath, Skullion!

04:19.280 --> 04:21.240
Are you a Dragon Slayer?

04:21.700 --> 04:24.380
Did you come here to slay me?

04:24.380 --> 04:26.450
No, not exactly.

04:27.100 --> 04:30.180
We're on a quest to seal five dragons.

04:30.180 --> 04:33.470
So if you're a good guy,
we need to figure something out.

04:33.470 --> 04:35.460
That's a way to sum it up.

04:35.720 --> 04:38.460
Ah, old Elefseria...

04:38.460 --> 04:40.340
He hasn't given up, has he?

04:40.340 --> 04:44.340
So, are you a good guy, or a bad guy?

04:44.340 --> 04:47.900
Natsu's so honest and unwavering, huh?

04:48.840 --> 04:51.430
I'll show you to my temple.

04:52.980 --> 04:54.060
Holy Water Dragon!

04:54.860 --> 04:58.140
Why would you bring a bunch
like that to the temple?

04:58.950 --> 05:00.780
This is Karameel.

05:00.780 --> 05:03.240
She looks after me and my affairs.

05:03.580 --> 05:08.160
Someone stole my power as a dragon.

05:08.600 --> 05:11.120
Someone called the White Mage.

05:11.120 --> 05:12.730
The White Mage?

05:12.730 --> 05:14.590
Sounds like the opposite of Zeref.

05:15.080 --> 05:16.670
We meet again.

05:16.670 --> 05:19.340
The one who took your power...

05:19.340 --> 05:22.130
The White Mage is who we need to eat.

05:22.130 --> 05:24.050
You who defile my temple...

05:24.340 --> 05:27.400
You're no longer the Water God Dragon.

05:27.400 --> 05:29.520
You're not worth eating!

05:33.450 --> 05:39.030
No matter how mighty your armor
might be, can it withstand heat?

05:40.860 --> 05:42.590
Burn!

05:43.450 --> 05:46.530
Fire Dragon King's Purgatory!

05:47.050 --> 05:49.160
But for now, we'll retreat.

05:50.140 --> 05:55.950
If you plan on chasing after dragons,
I'm sure our paths will cross again.

05:55.950 --> 05:57.500
That's when you'll see...

05:58.010 --> 06:03.470
the true terror of Diabolos.

06:05.300 --> 06:06.900
Holy Water Dragon!

06:11.000 --> 06:12.430
What's going on?

06:15.550 --> 06:16.690
Run!

06:17.900 --> 06:21.740
When we returned to Ermina
after our battle with Diabolos,

06:21.740 --> 06:25.410
Mercphobia had turned into a dragon
and was going berserk.

06:28.080 --> 06:30.540
So this is a dragon called a god.

06:32.920 --> 06:33.830
Here it comes!

06:42.980 --> 06:47.340
Dragon Slaying Ultimate Technique:
Crimson Flare Flaming Blade!

06:51.270 --> 06:52.770
Natsu's flames!

06:52.770 --> 06:54.310
They've all been put out?!

06:58.740 --> 07:00.270
I'm getting sucked in!

07:06.110 --> 07:08.480
Natsu!

07:12.960 --> 07:14.370
Natsu?

07:19.040 --> 07:22.860
This one belongs to me, Water Dragon God.

07:22.860 --> 07:24.720
Hands off.

07:27.130 --> 07:29.050
It feels like...

07:29.550 --> 07:30.810
...a dragon!

07:31.630 --> 07:32.700
He looks like...

07:37.530 --> 07:38.920
Igneel.

07:39.850 --> 07:42.170
Let me give you a hand. Just a little.

07:50.350 --> 07:51.390
He's...

07:51.390 --> 07:53.080
Turning the town into a sea of fire!

07:53.460 --> 07:55.720
It's a present for you.

07:55.720 --> 07:59.510
It'll give you a power, although temporarily.

07:59.510 --> 08:02.710
Listen, Fire Dragon Slayer.

08:02.710 --> 08:05.890
By the way, I'm not gonna fight Mercphobia.

08:05.890 --> 08:08.430
If I did, you wouldn't improve.

08:08.980 --> 08:12.610
Huh? What's your objective here?

08:12.610 --> 08:15.940
My objective is to fight you...

08:15.940 --> 08:18.390
after you get much stronger.

08:18.950 --> 08:22.860
Completely and thoroughly, until
one of us turns into burned charcoal.

08:27.420 --> 08:29.460
You've already noticed it, right?

08:29.460 --> 08:31.570
The scent of Igneel...

08:33.530 --> 08:36.790
I am the Fire Dragon God, Ignia.

08:37.870 --> 08:40.180
The true son of Igneel.

08:41.820 --> 08:43.280
It's all right.

08:43.280 --> 08:46.570
If you don't feel motivated,
I can help you there...

08:46.570 --> 08:51.130
By killing off your "friends"
one by one, if necessary.

08:59.710 --> 09:03.800
I see, so your power increases
with your emotions.

09:03.800 --> 09:06.360
Use that on Mercphobia.

09:10.780 --> 09:13.350
We'll meet again, Natsu!

09:18.250 --> 09:22.120
Damn it!

09:31.500 --> 09:33.930
I hate to admit it, but these flames...

09:35.280 --> 09:37.390
They smell like Igneel.

09:45.590 --> 09:48.190
They're giving me power!

09:48.780 --> 09:52.150
Now I'm all fired up!

10:01.500 --> 10:04.760
Fire Dragon King's Brilliant Flame!

10:08.670 --> 10:10.300
He pulverized water?!

10:20.390 --> 10:21.450
Did he do it?

10:21.450 --> 10:22.570
Not yet!

10:23.830 --> 10:24.810
Everyone, follow me!

10:25.410 --> 10:27.140
I can't beat him alone!

10:27.140 --> 10:29.780
I was able to beat Acnologia
because you helped me!

10:30.200 --> 10:31.990
And that'll never change...

10:31.990 --> 10:34.240
I can't fight without you!

10:34.240 --> 10:38.200
Please lend me your strength!

10:38.600 --> 10:39.830
Take this!

10:44.740 --> 10:45.670
And this!

10:49.960 --> 10:56.740
Fire Dragon King's Demolishing Strike!

10:59.390 --> 11:05.280
We didn't hear the details of what Ignia,
the Fire Dragon God, said to Natsu.

11:05.280 --> 11:10.020
But Natsu's flame after eating
Ignia's fire felt almost bloodcurdling,

11:05.850 --> 11:07.390
Not yet.

11:07.390 --> 11:08.810
His body's still here.

11:08.810 --> 11:10.020
Natsu!

11:10.460 --> 11:14.900
and for the first time ever,
I was scared of Natsu's fire.

11:14.900 --> 11:18.370
It's... it's over, Natsu.

11:16.630 --> 11:20.410
Natsu wasn't himself even after he defeated
Mercphobia, but he would be all right.

11:19.040 --> 11:20.410
It's okay.

11:21.550 --> 11:23.870
It's okay. I've got you.

11:24.360 --> 11:27.330
Natsu, I've got you.

11:28.380 --> 11:29.580
My goodness...

11:33.280 --> 11:34.380
I'm terribly sorry.

11:36.160 --> 11:38.790
Can you imagine if he had died?

11:38.790 --> 11:40.350
Don't say that.

11:41.350 --> 11:46.210
But that settles everything... I guess?

11:48.830 --> 11:52.860
Our next destination is
the central area of Guiltina!

11:52.860 --> 11:54.410
I'm getting fired up!

11:54.410 --> 11:55.780
Aye!

11:55.780 --> 11:58.540
After that, we headed to a city called Drasil

11:58.540 --> 12:02.530
to look for the second dragon,
Aldoron, the Wood Dragon God.

12:03.150 --> 12:07.120
We were told that the Wood Dragon God
was the biggest dragon in the world,

12:07.120 --> 12:12.060
but we didn't expect that the whole city
of Drasil would be on Aldoron's hand.

12:12.060 --> 12:14.090
That's a bit too big, no?

12:19.980 --> 12:22.720
Before we encountered the White Mage,

12:22.720 --> 12:26.680
something crazy was happening
at Fairy Tail as well.

12:26.680 --> 12:29.140
I-I am...

12:29.780 --> 12:31.550
I am Touka.

12:31.550 --> 12:34.110
I came to join the guild where Natsu is.

12:34.920 --> 12:37.070
No, it's Natsu-sama.

12:37.660 --> 12:39.530
Natsu-sama is my...

12:39.530 --> 12:41.840
my sweet darling!

12:42.990 --> 12:45.740
So, where is my Natsu-sama?

12:46.150 --> 12:47.830
My sweet darling!

12:49.690 --> 12:50.750
No doubt about it.

12:51.140 --> 12:53.220
That's one of Fairy Tail's new recruits.

12:53.220 --> 12:56.720
They introduced her to me
when I visited Magnolia last month.

12:56.720 --> 12:58.050
What?!

12:58.050 --> 13:00.600
Who is this woman?

13:02.140 --> 13:05.430
She could be as dangerous as Zeref.

13:05.740 --> 13:08.390
The great witch who's lived 100 years...

13:08.920 --> 13:11.120
Touka, the White Mage.

13:15.900 --> 13:17.650
I've finally found you.

13:19.030 --> 13:25.990
The founder of Rebellious, the White Magic
Cult that is the counterpart to Avatar.

13:26.620 --> 13:31.800
"White magic" sounds harmless,
but its philosophy is quite dangerous.

13:31.800 --> 13:35.160
Turning the world white,
everything into nothingness...

13:35.660 --> 13:37.880
That's the Creed of White Magic.

13:37.880 --> 13:40.840
Why get close to Fairy Tail?

13:41.790 --> 13:43.800
Because they're too strong.

13:44.310 --> 13:47.760
Magical energy of that magnitude
pooled in one spot...

13:47.760 --> 13:51.130
Excessive magical power will
bring on destruction and chaos.

13:51.130 --> 13:53.950
Those who oppose the Creed of White Magic...

13:53.950 --> 13:58.440
They must be returned to nothingness,
as fairies are for tales only.

13:58.840 --> 14:01.960
Anyhow, I'm not interested in debating.

14:02.360 --> 14:04.110
You, after all, will become nothing.

14:09.180 --> 14:11.500
Strong magical energy creates black.

14:11.820 --> 14:14.840
Yes, like that of Zeref.

14:14.840 --> 14:19.840
Before that happens,
I must paint the world white.

14:23.900 --> 14:25.830
R-Run...

14:26.820 --> 14:28.680
Now's your chance.

14:29.790 --> 14:35.230
Before she comes back to the surface!

14:35.810 --> 14:37.310
You're under arrest!

14:38.710 --> 14:40.560
Another personality?

14:40.560 --> 14:45.660
So the White Mage and Touka are
two personalities, living in one body?

14:46.630 --> 14:49.810
What is going on?

14:51.210 --> 14:54.960
My body has been taken over
by the White Mage.

14:55.360 --> 15:00.570
With Separation Enchantment Magic,
I thought maybe I could drive her out of me.

15:03.630 --> 15:07.300
Would you stop giving away my secrets, Touka?

15:16.000 --> 15:20.650
Touka, the White Mage, controlled
the members of Fairy Tail and Jellal

15:20.650 --> 15:23.680
and brought them to Guiltina, where we were.

15:27.910 --> 15:32.080
She's using our friends
to destroy the towns' orbs?!

15:32.080 --> 15:35.960
The White Mage is trying to have the orb
in each of the five towns destroyed

15:35.960 --> 15:38.990
so that she can control Aldoron,
the Wood Dragon God.

15:38.990 --> 15:41.630
It won't work while they're being controlled.

15:41.950 --> 15:44.340
It might, if they're unconscious.

15:45.230 --> 15:48.800
So to save our friends,
we've got to fight them, huh?

15:49.680 --> 15:53.790
It's the Battle of Fairy Tail in Drasil!

15:53.790 --> 15:56.100
I'm getting fired up!

15:56.100 --> 15:57.480
Not exactly...

16:04.040 --> 16:06.610
Taking three on at once is a pain.

16:06.610 --> 16:08.460
I'll freeze you all!

16:08.460 --> 16:09.810
Ice Make...

16:11.070 --> 16:12.910
My magic won't activate?!

16:14.220 --> 16:15.420
Enchantment.

16:15.420 --> 16:18.960
Inside it, you can't use Ice Magic.

16:21.920 --> 16:25.880
You want me to use only the devil part
of the Devil Slaying magic?

16:26.340 --> 16:28.380
There's no telling what's gonna happen.

16:39.360 --> 16:42.430
Of course I feel pain...

16:42.430 --> 16:45.550
I'm beating up my own friends.

16:51.540 --> 16:54.200
It might hurt a little,
so I'm sorry about that.

16:59.900 --> 17:03.540
Star Dress Mix: Leo-Virgo Form!

17:03.540 --> 17:05.300
O light of Regulus!

17:06.000 --> 17:07.970
O simmer of Spica!

17:09.590 --> 17:11.860
Leon Maiden!

17:17.510 --> 17:21.180
Where there are dragons,
that's where you are.

17:21.180 --> 17:22.980
Aren't you, Fairy Tail?

17:22.980 --> 17:24.270
Diabolos...

17:24.270 --> 17:26.270
Was it you who erased her?

17:28.560 --> 17:33.930
Fighting Mira-san and Elfman was tough
on its own, but then Diabolos showed up.

17:33.930 --> 17:36.740
What's going to happen?! But...

17:37.480 --> 17:41.710
I think I've come up
with a way to save everyone.

17:41.710 --> 17:43.510
Cana-san!

17:43.510 --> 17:47.670
Seriously? She's drunk even under hypnosis?

17:48.080 --> 17:50.520
Sorry, but I'll take you down in one hit.

17:52.090 --> 17:55.390
River of light, guided by fairies, gather!

17:55.390 --> 17:58.850
Shine now, to break the fangs of evil!

17:59.190 --> 18:00.980
Fairy Glitter?!

18:01.300 --> 18:03.410
In the middle of the town?!

18:03.410 --> 18:04.440
Is she insane?!

18:09.040 --> 18:12.360
I know Cana carries them around with her.

18:12.950 --> 18:15.000
There, I found them!

18:15.000 --> 18:16.410
Magic Cards!

18:16.890 --> 18:21.830
We can use these to gather everyone
and protect them at the same time.

18:22.370 --> 18:24.540
I'm Wraith, the Spirit Dragon.

18:24.970 --> 18:26.880
Don't get in my way!

18:26.880 --> 18:29.070
Around the same time, Natsu and Wendy

18:29.070 --> 18:31.550
were apparently fighting
with more members of Diabolos.

18:31.550 --> 18:34.170
I'll be taking your power.

18:36.710 --> 18:37.570
But...

18:41.860 --> 18:43.640
What power.

18:44.100 --> 18:47.200
This is his magical energy!

18:53.040 --> 18:56.110
...the real Gramps is much stronger!

18:56.660 --> 19:00.990
Fire Dragon King's Demolishing Strike!

19:01.900 --> 19:06.460
So, I was a wizard of Fairy Tail.

19:07.050 --> 19:12.350
The bond of the guild that's thicker than
blood created this level of synchronization.

19:13.460 --> 19:16.430
Thank you for finding me.

19:17.320 --> 19:18.810
Wraith.

19:20.720 --> 19:23.350
I've missed you.

19:23.350 --> 19:25.990
I've missed you, too, Makarov.

19:29.620 --> 19:31.860
Hold on, Charle. This scent...

19:34.150 --> 19:36.450
Here... again...

19:36.450 --> 19:39.280
New prey!

19:46.600 --> 19:49.260
See? You breathe no more.

19:49.260 --> 19:50.480
Wendy!

19:57.880 --> 19:59.970
I'm going with everything I've got!

20:05.680 --> 20:08.130
With everything I've got...

20:12.070 --> 20:14.610
Happy-sama!

20:14.920 --> 20:16.390
I'm terribly sorry!

20:16.390 --> 20:19.070
I mistook the name of the one I love!

20:19.070 --> 20:22.270
It's the second biggest blunder of my life!

20:22.270 --> 20:24.080
So it's not the biggest...

20:24.380 --> 20:26.510
The biggest one is obvious!

20:26.510 --> 20:30.040
It's to have had my body
taken over by the White Mage!

20:30.440 --> 20:34.050
I know! Perhaps I can go back
to my original form now.

20:40.390 --> 20:42.740
You are a cat!

20:42.740 --> 20:44.600
S-So cute...

21:02.070 --> 21:04.990
Lightning Dragon's Heavenward Halberd!

21:05.670 --> 21:08.450
Tenrin: Blumenblatt!

21:20.790 --> 21:24.170
I was concerned about
the defense of the guild

21:24.570 --> 21:28.110
since I left to take on the
100 Years Quest with the others.

21:28.570 --> 21:31.650
I never knew you were this strong, Laxus.

21:32.400 --> 21:34.400
Now I have nothing to worry about.

21:34.710 --> 21:38.420
But next time, I'll win... no matter what.

21:44.670 --> 21:47.990
That's my line.

21:48.640 --> 21:51.620
My magical energy is completely drained.

21:56.720 --> 21:59.800
I cannot be too careful around her.

21:59.800 --> 22:02.760
It's about time I made
you listen to me.

22:09.190 --> 22:09.890
Take this!

22:17.310 --> 22:19.520
Touka, just you wait.

22:19.520 --> 22:22.150
I'll rescue you, I swear!

22:22.150 --> 22:25.570
Happy can be pretty reliable.

22:25.570 --> 22:28.520
I have to rescue everyone
in the guild as soon as possible.

22:29.220 --> 22:34.290
The 100 Years Quest is definitely tough,
but I've got Natsu and the others with me,

22:34.290 --> 22:35.930
so it'll be all right.

22:35.930 --> 22:39.660
Also, I want to find the key of Aquarius,

22:39.660 --> 22:42.980
which is supposed to be
somewhere on this continent.

22:42.980 --> 22:45.120
Yes! I'll do my best!

22:50.150 --> 22:52.640
Anyhow, we've got to do it!

22:53.120 --> 22:55.100
Here I come, Aldoron!

22:55.460 --> 22:59.770
Fire Dragon King's Demolishing Strike!

23:00.830 --> 23:03.240
That is quite enough!

23:12.740 --> 23:14.790
This is my magical energy!

23:17.900 --> 23:19.460
Destroy it immediately!

23:23.880 --> 23:25.460
This is bad!

23:25.460 --> 23:26.760
Gray-sama!

23:27.940 --> 23:29.720
I can't stay standing!

23:36.960 --> 23:40.680
This world should become
distorted and deformed.

23:40.680 --> 23:43.900
Under the moonlight...

23:43.900 --> 23:49.910
Next Time

23:43.900 --> 23:49.910
Clinging Dragon Berserk
